  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Countering and Preventing Terrorism in Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;OO: The relevant departments of Government of Pakistan are capable to investigate and adjudicate terrorism cases; the victims of terrorism have better support as legal frameworks are in place; and the community has enhanced resilience against extremism.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;SO1:&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt; The Criminal Justice Institutions effectively investigate, process, and adjudicate terrorism cases, leading to improved counterterrorism efforts and the successful prosecution of terrorists. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;SO2:&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Support mechanism for victims of terrorism is strengthened, with enhanced coordination, institutional capacity, and effective funding mechanism&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;SO3:&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;The community resilience against violent extremism is strengthened by establishing integrated networks and promoting civil society engagement&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
